                    Scene @ACT_II_START: @LIT.scenes.ACT_II_START.title

[Enter Lady Macbeth and Hecate]

Hecate:
 You are as rotten as Horatio.

Hecate:
 Remember a toad.

Hecate:
 Remember a cat.

Lady Macbeth:
 Let us proceed to scene @PASS_PARA_READ_GLYPH.


                    Scene @PASS_PARA_READ_GLYPH: @LIT.scenes.PASS_PARA_READ_GLYPH.title

Lady Macbeth:
 @LIT.characters.lady_macbeth.recall.hewn_glyph

Hecate:
 You are as cursed as the difference between yourself and a cat.

Lady Macbeth:
 Are you as villainous as the sum of a little furry black cat and a black cat?

Hecate:
 If so, let us proceed to scene @PASS_PARA_CLOSE_PARAGRAPH.

Hecate:
 If not, let us proceed to scene @PASS_PARA_KEEP_GLYPH.


                    Scene @PASS_PARA_KEEP_GLYPH: @LIT.scenes.PASS_PARA_KEEP_GLYPH.title

Hecate:
 Remember myself.

Hecate:
 Are you as horrid as nothing?

Lady Macbeth:
 If so, let us proceed to scene @PASS_PARA_CLOSE_FINAL.

Lady Macbeth:
 If not, let us return to scene @PASS_PARA_READ_GLYPH.


                    Scene @PASS_PARA_CLOSE_PARAGRAPH: @LIT.scenes.PASS_PARA_CLOSE_PARAGRAPH.title

Hecate:
 Remember nothing.

Hecate:
 Are you as cursed as nothing?

Lady Macbeth:
 If so, let us proceed to scene @FRAME_REVERSE_OPEN.

Lady Macbeth:
 If not, let us proceed to scene @PASS_PARA_SKIP_BLANK.


                    Scene @PASS_PARA_SKIP_BLANK: @LIT.scenes.PASS_PARA_SKIP_BLANK.title

Lady Macbeth:
 @LIT.characters.lady_macbeth.recall.blank_glyph

Hecate:
 You are as rotten as the difference between yourself and a cat.

Lady Macbeth:
 Are you as mighty as the sum of a little furry black cat and a black cat?

Hecate:
 If so, let us proceed to scene @PASS_PARA_AFTER_BLANK.

Hecate:
 If not, let us proceed to scene @PASS_PARA_OPEN_WITH_GLYPH.


                    Scene @PASS_PARA_AFTER_BLANK: @LIT.scenes.PASS_PARA_AFTER_BLANK.title

Hecate:
 Are you as horrid as nothing?

Lady Macbeth:
 If so, let us proceed to scene @FRAME_REVERSE_OPEN.

Lady Macbeth:
 If not, let us return to scene @PASS_PARA_SKIP_BLANK.


                    Scene @PASS_PARA_OPEN_WITH_GLYPH: @LIT.scenes.PASS_PARA_OPEN_WITH_GLYPH.title

Hecate:
 Remember a cat.

Hecate:
 Remember myself.

Hecate:
 Are you as horrid as nothing?

Lady Macbeth:
 If so, let us proceed to scene @PASS_PARA_CLOSE_FINAL.

Lady Macbeth:
 If not, let us return to scene @PASS_PARA_READ_GLYPH.


                    Scene @PASS_PARA_CLOSE_FINAL: @LIT.scenes.PASS_PARA_CLOSE_FINAL.title

Hecate:
 Remember nothing.

Lady Macbeth:
 Let us proceed to scene @FRAME_REVERSE_OPEN.


                    Scene @FRAME_REVERSE_OPEN: @LIT.scenes.FRAME_REVERSE_OPEN.title

[Exit Hecate]

[Enter Puck]

Lady Macbeth:
 Remember a wolf.

Lady Macbeth:
 Let us proceed to scene @FRAME_REVERSE_POP.


                    Scene @FRAME_REVERSE_POP: @LIT.scenes.FRAME_REVERSE_POP.title

Puck:
 @LIT.characters.puck.recall.masons_stone

Puck:
 Are you as noble as a wolf?

Lady Macbeth:
 If so, let us proceed to scene @ACT_II_DONE.

Lady Macbeth:
 Remember myself.

Lady Macbeth:
 Let us return to scene @FRAME_REVERSE_POP.


